<title>INDIA: Gabriel India 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>Gabriel India 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 139.4 vs    118.2</p>
<p>    Net sales		2,075   vs  1,578.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	50   vs     50</p>
<p>    Interest costs	   149.2 vs     72.1</p>
<p>    Gross profit	     207.8 vs    182.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Gabriel India Ltd, which makes car parts including shock absorbers, struts and front forks, released the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
